# Event Notification Service API

FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://localhost:8080

# Overview

This API receives domain events and returns asynchronous acknowledgements.

Authentication for event submission uses JWT bearer tokens.

# Group Health

## Health Check [/health]

### Get health status [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
          "status": "ok"
        }

+ Response 503 (application/json)

        {
          "status": "error",
          "message": "database unavailable"
        }

# Group Metrics

## Prometheus Metrics [/metrics]

### Get metrics [GET]

Returns Prometheus metrics in text exposition format.

+ Response 200 (text/plain)

# Group Events

## Submit Event [/api/v1/events]

### Submit a domain event [POST]

Accepts a supported event and returns an event id.

+ Request UserRegistered (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer <jwt>
            Idempotency-Key: 6b9a1f90-6b71-4f0a-9a3d-4b72e4d9e91a

    + Body

            {
              "event_type": "UserRegistered",
              "payload": {
                "user_id": "12345",
                "email": "user@example.com",
                "name": "John Doe"
              }
            }

+ Response 202 (application/json)

        {
          "id": "evt-1"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "missing or invalid Idempotency-Key"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "invalid JSON body"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "invalid event",
          "code": "invalid_argument"
        }

+ Response 401 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "missing or invalid authorization header",
          "code": "unauthenticated"
        }

+ Response 401 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "invalid token",
          "code": "unauthenticated"
        }

+ Response 415 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "Content-Type must be application/json"
        }

+ Response 429 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "rate limit exceeded"
        }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "internal error",
          "code": "internal"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
          "error": "request timeout",
          "code": "timeout"
        }

# Data Structures

## SubmitEventRequest (object)

+ event_type: `UserRegistered` (required, string)
+ payload (required, object)

## SubmitEventResponse (object)

+ id: `evt-1` (required, string)

# Notes

Supported event_type values: UserRegistered, PasswordResetRequested, OrderPaid, OrderShipped.

Idempotency-Key must be a UUID.

Idempotency scope is the pair (Idempotency-Key, event_type).
